SUMMARY:Carols in the Village
DESCRIPTION:🎶❤️ CAROLS IN THE VILLAGE \nThere’s something magical about Christmas carols\, twinkling lights and coming together as a community! \nJoin us for a festive evening of Christmas music\, warm cider and holiday cheer as we stroll through Bloor West Village\, stopping along the way to sing some of our favourite Christmas classics. \n📍 Starting at Candy Cane Lane Courtyard\n📅 Wednesday\, December 2\n🕔 6:00PM–7:30 PM \nBring your festive spirit\, bundle up and get ready to sing\, stroll and celebrate the season with us! \nLet’s make a little Christmas magic in the Village! 🎄 \nRSVP required
URL:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/event/carols-in-the-village/
LOCATION:Village Courtyard\, 2329 Bloor St W (near RBC Bank)\, 2329 Bloor St West
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Carols-in-the-village-2026-e1795557314258.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloor West Village BIA":MAILTO:info@bloorwestvillagebia.com
END:VEVENT
