SUMMARY:Humber Heritage Walk!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Humber Heritage Walk!\nDiscover the stories\, history and natural beauty of our neighbourhood! Join local nature expert and photographer Richard Bod for a guided community walk exploring the scenic Humber River and the historic charm of Old Mill! \nAlong the way\, you’ll learn fascinating untold local stories\, admire architectural treasures and learn about the area’s natural environment and wildlife of the Humber River. \nWhether you’re a history enthusiast\, nature lover or simply enjoy exploring your community\, this is a wonderful opportunity to get moving\, connect with others and discover a little more about the place we call home. \nPresented by Feet First Clinic\, featuring local nature expert and photographer Richard Bod. \nThe walking tour begins and concludes in Bloor West Village. \nSaturday\, December 12 | 10:30 AM – 12:00 PM \nMeeting Location: Feet First Clinic\, 2481 Bloor St West. \nRegistration: $5 + service fee\, with all proceeds from the $5 registration fee supporting the Bloor West Food Bank. \nLimited to 25 participants. Registration Now Open! \n  \nCome for the walk\, stay for the Village! Shop\, dine and explore Bloor West Village before or after your adventure. \nPhoto credit: 2026 Richard Bod \n 
URL:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/event/humber-heritage-walk/
LOCATION:Feet First Foot Clinic\, 2481 Bloor St W\, Toronto\, ON\, M6S 1P8\, Canada
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Social-Static-Post-7-e1795637155578.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloor West Village BIA":MAILTO:info@bloorwestvillagebia.com
END:VEVENT
